  "goodToKnow": "Die Einkünfte (plural only) means income or earnings, especially in tax language. German income tax law lists seven types of Einkünfte, including from employment (aus nichtselbständiger Arbeit), self-employment, renting (Vermietung und Verpachtung) and capital. In everyday speech, people say das Einkommen. Members of the Bundestag must publish their Nebeneinkünfte (side income). From einkommen (to come in)."
